'''Kombat''' is a 1on1 tournament starting '''September 23rd''', with split divisions depending on amount of signups.

This time it will be full on focus on fresh new map. It will be bravado together with 4 new maps created within the last year.

== Format ==
* '''Group stage''' (small groups)
* '''Single elimination playoffs'''
* 1 match per week.
* All matches are {{Abbr|BO5|Best of 5}}

