== Rules ==
* Map order: All games are BO5, cmd rnd for first pick, after that alternate picking. P1/P2/P1/P2/remaining map.
* Settings: Standard settings by typing "/1on1" | To add match tag type "/1on1 Kombat"
* Pause rules: Each player is allowed one pause per match, once you have used a pause and use it again, you have forfeited the map.
* Ping rules: Find a server that keeps both players around the same ping +/- 13ms, if no such server can be found, the lowest ping player will have to use cl_delay_packet to get closer to the higher ping player. If there's a dispute in what server should be used, contact admin in discord.
* Client: ezQuake 3.6.x. For your own sake, update your client!
** Remember to check with f_version
* Ruleset: smackdown/qcon
** Remember to check with f_ruleset
* Walkovers will be given by admin when a deadline passes. Try to keep scheduling talk in <mark>#scheduling</mark> to avoid blame or confusion.
* Reporting: send screenshots in [http://discord.quake.world/ discord] channel: <mark>#kombat</mark>.
* Last chance qualifiers!
** Since there are only three groups per division, there will be a battle for the last two playoff spots between all third place finishers in each group. Never give up!

